{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "b2c03e5da4931331cab774294ea679991b1aed3c829803e5e2ff79952129b16a", "ja": "いつかは、きっと", "zh": "总有一天，一定", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2051c54f4a0f6e601b4a3a7c324a91cc2087288119a20aacb6b31761a6894b1f", "ja": "エレナの危機だと思い、駆けつける4人。\nだが当のエレナとプロデューサーから既に\n解決済だと伝えられる。帰りにアイスを食べ\nようと話しながら、恵美は真珠星も自分達と\n同じような時間を過ごせたらと願う。", "zh": "以为是爱丽娜陷入危机而赶来的4人。\n但爱丽娜本人和制作人已经告知他们事情解决了。回去的路上，惠美一边说着要去吃冰淇淋，一边希望真珠星也能和她们度过相同的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "ead6c9c4d765a296307311010c5760537bb3cece638fa0a9669d222ba1200102", "ja": "エレナは……まだ来てないみたいだね。", "zh": "艾蕾娜……好像还没来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "0e2e188b8f499b3b6939be8b4ac2fafc6fff55314a5d593ebb8ad8408898cbbd", "ja": "ていうか、アタシだけのつもりだったのに……\nなんで、みんなまで来ちゃうの！？", "zh": "话说回来，我本来只打算自己来的……\n为什么大家也都跟来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "370b7aece561bc3cb836bb1dcf96f7beb1d96cdea260e0a8d68fc067f942af84", "ja": "だ、だって！\n私たちも、エレナさんのことが心配ですから！", "zh": "因、因为！\n我们也很担心艾丽娜小姐啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "3afbfba407e6a8b28f11eda37595a06ffc01730fbb0fbe09b5c3efb0786ff919", "ja": "そうよ、恵美。エレナの危機だっていうのに、\n黙っているわけにはいかないわ。", "zh": "没错，惠美。明知道是艾丽娜的危机，\n怎么能默不作声呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "fe48c988c14a272c8633e1f35aa37d2e012ebb9f07316d855f12bbb5e2897334", "ja": "何かあった時のためにも、大勢の方が絶対いいよ！\nナンパする人って一対一には強いらしいんだけど……。", "zh": "为了以防万一，人多绝对更好！听说搭讪的人好像很擅长一对一，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "016f9b73928356ee85734f8dc88197d93899b0f55725d2683eb25d9b97cb32bb", "ja": "大勢の女の人には弱い、って聞いたことあるから！\n4人なら、火力では負けないよ！　一気に攻めよう！", "zh": "但我听说过，他们对上一大群女生就很没辙！\n有4个人的话，我们在火力上可不会输！一口气攻过去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "72a090d296e66f3a5f1de34a88d1688868297b9d00ef5ce66bc9757548c397fe", "ja": "へえ～、そうなんだ……。\nそれ、今後のために覚えとこ！", "zh": "哦～原来是这样啊……\n这个为了以后的事，可得记住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "32b6cd54ee43203cb1004125189ab297851ed979f25030e1b21c092e21ef7d69", "ja": "ん……？\nみんな、こんなところでどうしたノ？", "zh": "嗯……？\n大家怎么会在这种地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "08f933f9c27df9a9bc7b937c71109166759ec13b2da5ddb17a1c9af67632e620", "ja": "ああっ！？　秒でバレた！\nエレナ、あの、これはね……！", "zh": "啊啊！？转眼就被发现了！\n艾蕾娜，那个，这个嘛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4ab193ae87cb7df755a5bb3f192ff395d59a591d848e03fa5fcf180157ee7a79", "ja": "あれ、恵美？　みんなも、\n今日は劇場で稽古の予定じゃ……？", "zh": "咦，惠美？大家也在啊，今天不是应该在剧场排练吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "3826e0632c994bd2176463a80d2311901fb4a4dafbb07655ad7cb9695de358b6", "ja": "えっ！？\n……{$P$}！？", "zh": "咦！？  \n……{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c62fb0eb8b6b18c59e2f4f036afea82bbbbd364f11cb41f9f6a7595f23bbe706", "ja": "ははあ。エレナをナンパした俳優さんの話と、\nお芝居の話が似てるから心配になったと……。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是因为搭讪艾莲娜的演员和戏剧的事情很相似，所以才担心啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "e17258cde18040f3b47d5313cf3a2d8e37ee8114b7f9d95b7197d6703241960d", "ja": "うん……でも、{$P$}、\n知ってたなら言ってくれてもよくない！？", "zh": "嗯……可是，{$P$}，既然你知道的话，至少也可以告诉我一声吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b0a4e54f7f6225b5bcc03fa08e5156126923d3cb40ef6092121c9f3439be94ad", "ja": "す、すまない。\n余計な心配をかけちゃったな。", "zh": "对、对不起。让你白白担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0954317064932158d42fc452a5d48ce4cbac52b78176a94cc43f09fb36ff5d82", "ja": "相手の人には、事務所から注意もしてもらったから。\nもう大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "对方那边，事务所也已经提醒过了。所以已经没事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "53415cb5f74584efa298d902d164a65dc28554d70e5aaf8296a2a56ab583ac49", "ja": "困ってたのはホントだけどネ。でも、すぐ\n{$P$}に相談したんだヨ。", "zh": "虽然确实很伤脑筋啦。不过，我马上就找\n{$P$}商量了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "658fe7dbbeb4606d3e95dd0aac415e79ad24f1202f688dbdaafd52b157d98c0a", "ja": "一緒に行って話をしてくれるって言ったから、\nこれで解決かなってワタシも思ってて……。", "zh": "因为你说会陪我一起去跟人谈谈，所以我也觉得这样应该就能解决了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "daf8a26253d727f5028ac6d0e6ac326c3d5228c035698ecf4dc2e6f60a1e8301", "ja": "でも、こんなにみんなを心配させるなら、\nちゃんと説明すればよかったネ……？", "zh": "不过，既然让大家这么担心，早点好好解释清楚就好了呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "39799ad370e8e9b2d688b2d98f0da96478dd417afe9814b64478d7e0d8689a97", "ja": "あっ、エレナちゃんは悪くないよ！？\n私たちこそ、勝手に大騒ぎしちゃってごめんね。", "zh": "啊，艾蕾娜不是故意的哦！？\n是我们擅自闹得这么大，才该说对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "7f0865f60c5d8d7818539d024a2771c5e42748f5c095a1c69b9bbb9a941ddf62", "ja": "私も、落ち着いて考えればよかったんだけど……\nエレナの一大事だって思ったら、つい……。", "zh": "我也应该冷静下来想想的……一想到这是艾蕾娜的大事，就不由得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "159554ab346c07e78a2be641766eeea0b5db6c781278877aa7301b8aa0645e2a", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい～！", "zh": "对、对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "84df23a4644500f0b52de2f9171d73c0d1684b028540fb89d33c806b0a718096", "ja": "ウウン、みんなが心配してくれてうれしいナ。\n撮影も終わったし、みんなで帰ろ～！", "zh": "不是的，大家这么担心我，我很开心呀。\n拍摄也结束了，大家一起回去吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "17376d76d7279d29b3f3d3aa1ef688c3681b09f85a2f93a59c639b4f69d44774", "ja": "暑いし、アイスでも食べようヨ♪\n今日くらいいいでしょ、{$P$}？", "zh": "天气这么热，去吃个冰淇淋吧♪\n今天就破个例嘛，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5be897cf2a9c197729bf1b8c5d85da5d16d30cb071b1644d499ad71b4507f7ab", "ja": "そうだな。みんなに心配かけた分、\n俺が全員にご馳走するよ。", "zh": "是啊。让大家担心了，这次我请大家吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "fb061720b4c82068462a9e4b3c03894eaaac37a0ef773e6c879f0f7f42cc52ae", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nよかったらお店、私が探します。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。要是不介意的话，就由我来找店吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "25d2a7013044e1474767c875e0c023c79b5de5188f36fb8f6b27e1e4a181413e", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんのセレクトなら、間違いなさそう！\n何にしようかな～♪", "zh": "如果是琴叶挑的，肯定不会错！\n选什么好呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "e389136ead4a1cf901680c1acc04571c1c3299a65ba92f5e41bccfb19f5fbf38", "ja": "ベリーたっぷりストロベリーに～♪\nのせちゃうぞ～チョコ&クッキ～♪", "zh": "草莓满满的草莓味～♪\n再加上巧克力和曲奇～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "dce1ce8e8267447185b2d5c59ad2304923044fff0689c18809afaaf9c285b9aa", "ja": "可奈ってば、二段いくつもりだな～？\nならアタシも、三段いっちゃおっかな！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "可奈这是打算做两层吧～？\n那我也来个三层好了！呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "5f1b1b0ac2981d4773900d3c31ae08bf2c0b6dfbfcbb3f3467f7c214c39013ea", "ja": "いいけど、みんな少しは加減してくれよ。", "zh": "是可以，但大家稍微节制一点啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "d5aa5ceba9b8792ef6bff0dab364da04bd0c33df2a61e6fe9200203025c3d30c", "ja": "わかってるって、{$P$}！\n……うん。わかってる！", "zh": "知道啦，{$P$}！\n……嗯，我知道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8cd2edb4f1a262cc1ec8a4ef7e623426a7748ef336ec239c0e7b31dccb4e40a0", "ja": "……恵美？", "zh": "……惠美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "d37a3bd7f9523700731e3d453ef6d74b4256e7a744a18d37d6eaa9055197cc0b", "ja": "メグミ？\nどうかしたの？", "zh": "惠美？\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "2d513ca3acf890c038e628420f834cede63f61e0d18976ba1021106a743261db", "ja": "あ、ううん。大したことじゃないんだけど……\n真珠星たちも、こうなるといいなーと思って。", "zh": "啊，没什么。虽然不是什么大事……\n我只是觉得，要是珍珠星她们也能变成这样就好了——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1035_036kan", "source_sha256": "4e5fcfdb65cebc14c09f1c99d5025745730e895e859a296f42d3406ff9a0035c", "ja": "真珠星ちゃんたち、ですか？", "zh": "真珠星的大家，是指她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "a31d637128cebf0e393e5f962fee63ce7478bfb463d78eafd0f7f96fbd7832df", "ja": "うん。アタシ、『I.V.』が4人になった時、すごい\nうれしかったんだ。真珠星に仲間が増えたんだーって。", "zh": "嗯。《I.V.》的人数达到4人的时候，我真的\n特别开心。因为珍珠星又多了新的伙伴嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "2f0c6a92c976c3e71f0c747236d1e84797232fca358e1853b670242609d8c743", "ja": "アタシも、劇場のみんなと……仲間と\n出会えたおかげで、アイドルが本当に楽しいからさ。", "zh": "我也是因为遇见了剧场的大家……遇见了伙伴，才真正觉得偶像活动很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "cd013854f540c00ba9b40fd5e20d5e30e64c305d027255482d2247a9c4e9f14b", "ja": "だから真珠星にも、仲間と一緒にいる時間とか……\nアイドルを、楽しいと思ってほしいなって。", "zh": "所以，我也希望真珠星能觉得，和伙伴们一起度过的时光……还有当偶像，是件快乐的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "ba29ee39ee585fe82769aac40710de4fc1103afa8e85e72788042a17f11a1a0b", "ja": "うん。……そう考えてみると本当に、\n今の私達みたいなんだね。", "zh": "嗯。……这么一想，真的\n就像现在的我们一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1040_020meg", "source_sha256": "0ecae0a720caa1175744701c0c1357cc617cd2c7a71fff5d2227b1eb71f862d0", "ja": "でしょ？　これから真珠星たちには、色んなことが\n起こると思うけど……。あ、だからこそ、かな？", "zh": "对吧？我想，今后珍珠星她们会遇到各种各样的事情……啊，正因为如此，才会这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "4813c282fd0f797c171bcab9dc5ffb9efc472a9daddd3bebd840f391b26c066a", "ja": "いつか真珠星たちが振り返った時に、\n楽しい思い出になってるといいよね。", "zh": "等哪天真珠星她们回过头来看时，\n要是能变成快乐的回忆就好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1042_017kth", "source_sha256": "7630bb982eaf5362b7cce877466e3d97813ede189a6369c7dae9c608bfc3ec3d", "ja": "アイドルを、楽しい思い出に……。\nそうだね。いつかは、きっと……。", "zh": "让偶像成为快乐的回忆……  \n是啊。总有一天，一定会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1043_018ele", "source_sha256": "cc2d64523cec21dd89c8d29b19985f064b31b2dffe55efe7e24e1ac9688df422", "ja": "だったらワタシたちも、楽しくお芝居しないとだヨ～♪\nネ、{$P$}？", "zh": "那我们也得开开心心地演戏才行哦～♪  \n对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1044_p", "source_sha256": "636e5f7ac316c3895aef92dd5c7d4e67d3eb1da3a3637a18e345803d1bfca0fb", "ja": "うん……そうだな。みんなが、\n楽しく演じる事ができれば、それが一番だと思う。", "zh": "嗯……你说得对。大家要是能\n开开心心地演出，那就是最好的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_06_1045_020meg", "source_sha256": "482247937d9abfc8b1cae83458489b9a1ad707529ec8d20523f257c961b75a0a", "ja": "そうと決まれば、本番に向けて気合い入れなきゃだね！\n行こ、みんな♪", "zh": "既然决定了，就得为正式演出打起精神来！\n走吧，大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
